  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;　（注）１　ＣＥＯ：Chief Executive Officer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left"&gt;ＣＯＯ：Chief Operating Officer&lt;/p&gt;
